# r13 head at full-body scale (BACK). Pixel artist 3. Hand-authored grid. (round-1 fixes)
# Same outline/landmarks as head_front (crown y5). Canvas 44 (turnaround x = x+26). Bow 42 px (x1-42): teardrop loops y4-16, 5x7 knot x19-23 y8-14;
# two tails from y14 run off the bottom edge (swallowtail ends at ~y40 on the body).
size: 44 40
legend:
